<h3>order= sorts in the SQL, sort= sorts what came back</h3>
<p>{albums order="price", rows=4, sort="title"}{$title} {$price}{notLast@albums}, {/notLast@albums}{/albums}</p>

<h3>first= and last= after the query</h3>
<p>{artists first=3}{$name}{notLast@artists}, {/notLast@artists}{/artists}</p>

<h3>The properties of the loop</h3>
<ul>
  {labels}<li>{current@labels/} of {count@labels/}: {$name}{if first@labels} <span class="dim">(first)</span>{/if}</li>{/labels}
</ul>
